{"suttaId":"an4.253","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[1852,1857],"vripara":"253"},"segments":{"an4.253:0.3":"Catutthavohārasuttaṃ","an4.253:1.1":"“Cattārome, bhikkhave, ariyavohārā.","an4.253:1.2":"Katame cattāro?","an4.253:1.3":"Diṭṭhe diṭṭhavāditā, sute sutavāditā, mute mutavāditā, viññāte viññātavāditā – ime kho, bhikkhave, cattāro ariyavohārā”ti.","an4.253:1.5":"Ekādasamaṃ.","an4.253:1.6":"Āpattibhayavaggo pañcamo.","an4.253:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an4.253:2.1":"Bhedaāpatti sikkhā ca, seyyā thūpārahena ca;","an4.253:2.3":"Paññāvuddhi bahukārā, vohārā caturo ṭhitāti.","an4.253:2.5":"Pañcamapaṇṇāsakaṃ samattaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
